---
name: Mapa interativo por retiro
description: Interactive polygon map overlay on farm images, accessed from retiro level, clickable pastos with dynamic data, monthly filter integration
type: feature
---
Tables: mapas (fazenda_id, imagem_url), pastos_mapa (mapa_id, pasto_id, coordenadas JSONB).
Storage bucket: mapas (public).
Admin creates/edits map, gerente/capataz view only. No actions inside map (read-only visual).
Colors: green=ideal, yellow=alto, red=baixo, gray=no data.
ACCESS: Map is accessed from RETIRO level only, never from fazenda level.
Routes: /admin/fazendas/:fazendaId/retiros/:retiroId/mapa (admin), /mapa/retiro/:retiroId (all roles).
Map data is filtered to show only pastos belonging to the selected retiro.
Button "Ver Mapa" appears in RetiroDetailPage and AdminRetiroPainelPage.
Components: MapaEditor, MapaViewer, PastoInfoModal, useMapaData hook.
